 "T5_rules_facts": [
  "Inalla Eminence: 'Whenever another nontoken Wizard you control enters, if Inalla is in the command zone or on the battlefield, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that Wizard. The token gains haste.' One {1} per trigger; tokens do not trigger Eminence (nontoken clause).",
  "Inalla ruling: the copy uses last known information if the Wizard has left the battlefield before Eminence resolves (Spellseeker/Scholar sacrifice lines keep working).",
  "Inalla's tap-five ability has no {T} symbol, so summoning-sick tokens can be tapped for it (Dualcaster Mage + Saw in Half infinite tokens win with Inalla on the battlefield).",
  "Dualcaster Mage: 'When this creature enters, copy target instant or sorcery spell.' It needs a live spell on the stack; Saw in Half (already in the 99) and Essence Flux (already in the 99) both form two-card loops with it (Spellbook 147-500, 147-4598).",
  "Micromancer: 'When this creature enters, you may search your library for an instant or sorcery card with mana value 1' - misses Tainted Pact, Demonic Tutor, Finale of Promise, Pact of Negation, Shallow Grave, Persist, Lively Dirge, Unmarked Grave, Brain Freeze, Borne Upon a Wind, Cabal Ritual, Final Fortune, Lim-Dul's Vault (T2).",
  "Kefka, Court Mage is legendary; the Inalla token copy and the original both trigger, then the legend rule keeps one (ruling noted in M6 Stage A)."
 ],
 "verdict": {
  "PASS_C_DUALCASTER_OVER_KEFKA": "Strongest evidence of the pool: +2 complete two-card combos using cards already in the 99, 3 MV flash vs 5 MV; RR castability lands-only 0.4605 at 10 cards vs Kefka 5-land 0.0958. BUT Dualcaster Mage was explicitly REMOVED by the owner in the 2026-10-14 rebuild; the brief forbids re-adding removed cards. Staged as OWNER_DECISION, not counted.",
  "PASS_C_MICROMANCER_OVER_KEFKA": "Owner-rejected by name ('four mana plus the Eminence payment is materially slower than Spellseeker'); T2 confirms it misses 13 of Spellseeker's 33 targets including Tainted Pact and Finale of Promise. REJECT.",
  "PASS_C_SNAPCASTER_OVER_TRAINER": "Snapcaster Mage was owner-removed; identical {1}{U} castability; Trainer already hits a noncreature nonland card in the top 4 with p=0.9731 (0.9994 with the Eminence copy). REJECT / owner decision only.",
  "TWO_PASS_C_COMBINED": "Union of the two above; both adds owner-removed. Staged for the owner, not counted.",
  "TWO_DATA_DEFENSEGRID_GIFTS": "Data-led package (cEDH 0.45 / 0.41). No combo delta; Defense Grid taxes our own off-turn FoW/Pact/Flusterstorm/Swan Song/REB/Offer; Gifts duplicates Intuition at 4 MV. REJECT.",
  "ONE_TIDEBINDER_OVER_TRAINER": "Absent from the cEDH sample (0/817 listed); 3 MV vs 2 MV; no combo delta. REJECT."
 },
